--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository has no runtime third-party dependencies. The server, the UI
toolchain, and the test harness are implemented against the Python standard
library and Node.js built-ins only.

Model artifacts are NOT bundled with this project. Loco references local model
files that you download and place yourself. Any model artifact remains under
its own license and terms, which apply independently of this project's
Apache-2.0 license. Refer to the individual artifact's documentation before
use, including for commercial use.

Benchmark suites under `evals/` and recorded results under `results/` are
original to this project.
